izes was both Emrakul's and her own.","participants":["nissa-revane","the-angel-of-the-trial","emrakul"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"The monster had taken over her body back on Innistrad.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=The%20monster%20had%20taken,body%20back%20on%20Innistrad.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=The%20monster%20had%20taken,body%20back%20on%20Innistrad.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e6","summary":"Through a cascade of nightmares, Nissa hears an inner voice telling her to stop, and realizes she is trapped in the trial's illusion.","participants":["nissa-revane","trial-of-knowledge"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"There had been one nightmare after another, each one cascading into the next.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=There%20had%20been%20one,cascading%20into%20the%20next.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=There%20had%20been%20one,cascading%20into%20the%20next.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e7","summary":"Nissa studies the leyline structure of the trap, finds a tiny gap with her eyes shut, widens it and steps through.","participants":["nissa-revane","trial-of-knowledge"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"major","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":51,"quote":"In the weavings of magic surrounding her, there was a tiny gap.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=In%20the%20weavings%20of,was%20a%20tiny%20gap.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=In%20the%20weavings%20of,was%20a%20tiny%20gap.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e8","summary":"Seeing through the illusions, Nissa witnesses a vision of a dark snake's shadow swearing to drain every world, starting with Amonkhet.","participants":["nissa-revane","nicol-bolas"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"major","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"For what I require, I would drain every world.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=For%20what%20I%20require%2C,would%20drain%20every%20world.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=For%20what%20I%20require%2C,would%20drain%20every%20world.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e9","summary":"Nissa sees a vision of eight stars, three of which go dark, leaving a pattern like horns.","participants":["nissa-revane"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":67,"quote":"Their new outline suggested a pair of horns.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=Their%20new%20outline%20suggested%20a%20pair%20of%20horns.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=Their%20new%20outline%20suggested%20a%20pair%20of%20horns.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e10","summary":"Visions show mummies mining blue ore, three children swallowed by the sands, a line of darkness stretching through thousands of worlds, and a golden sun disc crumbling.","participants":["nissa-revane"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":74,"quote":"she saw an unbroken line of darkness from Amonkhet all the way back to the beginning of the line.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=she%20saw%20an%20unbroken,beginning%20of%20the%20line.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=she%20saw%20an%20unbroken,beginning%20of%20the%20line.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e11","summary":"The illusory angel appears, asks if Nissa is pawn or queen, and tells her to stop being a piece and be the hand that moves.","participants":["nissa-revane","the-angel-of-the-trial"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"major","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":92,"quote":"Stop being a piece, Nissa. Be the hand that moves.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=Stop%20being%20a%20piece%2C,the%20hand%20that%20moves.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=Stop%20being%20a%20piece%2C,the%20hand%20that%20moves.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e12","summary":"Kefnet appears and furiously demands who mocks his trial.","participants":["kefnet","nissa-revane"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"major","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":94,"quote":"It was the god himself, Kefnet.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=It%20was%20the%20god%20himself%2C%20Kefnet.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=It%20was%20the%20god%20himself%2C%20Kefnet.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e13","summary":"Kefnet plucks Nissa's thoughts and tells her knowledge is earned, offering dissolution as kindness to the unworthy.","participants":["kefnet","nissa-revane"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"major","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"Dissolution is my kindness for you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=Dissolution%20is%20my%20kindness%20for%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=Dissolution%20is%20my%20kindness%20for%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e14","summary":"Nissa recognizes that Kefnet is made of corrupted leylines, and weaves a spell that adds a new fiber of mana to them, altering him so he no longer wants to destroy her.","participants":["nissa-revane","kefnet","nicol-bolas"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"major","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":106,"quote":"She pulled it, and added a new fiber of mana to its mix.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=She%20pulled%20it%2C%20and,mana%20to%20its%20mix.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=She%20pulled%20it%2C%20and,mana%20to%20its%20mix.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Hand That Moves\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Apr 2017."}},{"id":"hand-moves-2017-04-26-e15","summary":"Kefnet declares she has passed her trial and flies away.","participants":["kefnet","nissa-revane"],"location":"trial-of-knowledge","importance":"minor","page":"stories/hand-moves-2017-04-26","order":323,"story_date":"2017-04-26","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":108,"quote":"You have passed your trial.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=You%20have%20passed%20your%20trial.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Hand That Moves","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2017-04-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hand-moves-2017-04-26#:~:text=You%20have%20passed%20y